01:07:19.500 --> 01:07:22.960
Well, let's get back to this Michael Hawley story, okay?
好了，让我们回到迈克尔·霍利这个故事上来，好吗？

1616
01:07:23.420 --> 01:07:27.140
This whole lunch has really strained things between Michael and Hawley.
这顿午餐让迈克尔和霍利之间的关系变得非常紧张。

1617
01:07:27.300 --> 01:07:32.440
When he gets back, he has a talking head where he says he won't even ride the elevator with her.
当他回来时，他有一个单人访谈，说他甚至不想和她同乘一部电梯。

1618
01:07:32.560 --> 01:07:35.740
And then he throws her leftovers in the trash.
然后他把她的剩菜扔进了垃圾桶。

1619
01:07:36.000 --> 01:07:36.560
Yeah.
是啊。

1620
01:07:36.780 --> 01:07:40.320
And then up in the kitchen, he's pouring himself some coffee.
接着在厨房里，他给自己倒咖啡。

1621
01:07:40.320 --> 01:07:41.960
She puts her cup out.
她把杯子递了过去。

1622
01:07:42.540 --> 01:07:47.460
Not only does he not pour coffee in her cup, he takes the whole pot and walks out of the kitchen.
他不仅没给她的杯子倒咖啡，还端起整壶咖啡走出了厨房。

1623
01:07:47.680 --> 01:07:50.480
She called Dunder Mifflin a workplace.
她把邓德·米夫林公司称为工作场所。

1624
01:07:51.320 --> 01:07:52.760
And it is his family.
而这里是他的家人。

1625
01:07:52.760 --> 01:07:54.120
And you do not do that.
你不能那样做。

1626
01:07:54.240 --> 01:07:54.780
You do not.
你绝对不能。

1627
01:07:55.040 --> 01:08:02.200
If Hawley wants to use the copier now, she's going to have to wait for Michael to copy a plaque off the wall firSt.
如果霍利现在想用复印机，她得先等迈克尔把墙上的牌匾复印完。

1628
01:08:02.640 --> 01:08:03.120
Yeah.
是啊。

1629
01:08:03.520 --> 01:08:05.200
Well, Hawley has a talking head.
嗯，霍利也有个单人访谈。

1630
01:08:05.440 --> 01:08:06.100
Things are tense.
气氛很紧张。

1631
01:08:06.340 --> 01:08:07.680
People are suspicious of her.
大家对她心存疑虑。

1632
01:08:07.680 --> 01:08:10.880
However, her best friend in the office won't even speak to her.
然而，她在办公室里最好的朋友甚至都不愿跟她说话。

1633
01:08:11.220 --> 01:08:13.120
So now we have a little window into Hawley.
所以现在我们对霍利有了一点了解。

1634
01:08:13.220 --> 01:08:15.280
She really sees Michael as her best friend.
她真的把迈克尔当成她最好的朋友。

1635
01:08:15.540 --> 01:08:19.720
Now, Angela, in the script, there was a scene here where Michael calls Toby.
安吉拉，剧本里有一场戏是迈克尔给托比打电话。

1636
01:08:20.200 --> 01:08:20.640
Yes.
是的。

1637
01:08:20.860 --> 01:08:22.120
For help with Hawley.
寻求关于霍利的帮助。

1638
01:08:22.260 --> 01:08:22.640
Yes.
是的。

1639
01:08:22.740 --> 01:08:23.960
It's in the deleted scenes.
那是在删减片段里。

1640
01:08:23.960 --> 01:08:33.580
Oh, guys, it's so good because Toby basically says at the end of all of this, oh, well, Michael, I think Hawley's doing the right thing.
哦，伙计们，那段太棒了，因为托比在最后基本上说，哦，好吧，迈克尔，我觉得霍利做得对。

1641
01:08:33.680 --> 01:08:39.100
And in fact, now that you've told me, I'm obligated to report this Meredith incident to HR as well.
事实上，既然你告诉了我，我也必须把梅雷迪思这件事上报给人力资源部。

1642
01:08:39.360 --> 01:08:39.500
Yeah.
是啊。

1643
01:08:40.520 --> 01:08:48.120
But that's how desperate Michael is, is he's going to call Toby, who I guess is still in a hospital in Costa Rica.
但迈克尔已经绝望到这种地步了，他竟然要给托比打电话，我猜托比当时还在哥斯达黎加的医院里。

1644
01:08:48.360 --> 01:08:50.180
And he's still not nice to him.
而且他对他依然很不客气。

1645
01:08:50.400 --> 01:08:53.220
He calls Toby for help, but he's still not nice.
他找托比帮忙，但态度还是很差。

1646
01:08:53.500 --> 01:08:57.440
This is not the last HR rep that's going to be involved.
这还不是最后一个介入的人力资源代表。

1647
01:08:57.660 --> 01:09:00.480
Kendall from corporate has called.
总公司的人力资源部肯德尔打来了电话。

1648
01:09:00.760 --> 01:09:05.040
And Hawley's going to come in Michael's office, and they're going to discuss it with Kendall.
霍利会走进迈克尔的办公室，他们将和肯德尔讨论这件事。

1649
01:09:05.420 --> 01:09:05.680
Yeah.
是啊。

1650
01:09:05.680 --> 01:09:10.600
We had a fan question from Megan Q, who voices Kendall from corporate HR.
我们收到了来自梅根·Q的粉丝提问，她就是总公司人力资源部肯德尔的配音演员。

1651
01:09:11.040 --> 01:09:13.560
Kendall was played by John Hartman.
肯德尔是由约翰·哈特曼饰演的。

1652
01:09:14.060 --> 01:09:28.740
Now, the role of Kendall was first mentioned in the episode The Job, when David Wallace mentions his dislike for the HR rep Kendall during Jim's job interview in New York.
肯德尔这个角色最早是在《工作》那一集中被提到的，当时大卫·华莱士在吉姆于纽约面试时，提到了他不喜欢人力资源代表肯德尔。

1653
01:09:28.900 --> 01:09:30.740
Wow, that's a major callback.
哇，这真是一个重大的前后呼应。

1654
01:09:31.020 --> 01:09:34.560
I know, but we also brought him up again in weight loss, I guess.
我知道，但我想我们在《减肥》那一集里也提过他。

1655
01:09:34.560 --> 01:09:36.080
And here's the thing.
重点是这个。

1656
01:09:36.280 --> 01:09:38.840
Kendall is going to come back two more times this season.
肯德尔在这个季度还会再出现两次。

1657
01:09:39.020 --> 01:09:43.660
He comes back in person in stress relief and company picnic.
他会在《压力缓解》和《公司野餐》中亲自登场。

1658
01:09:43.840 --> 01:09:46.200
He's always played by John Hartman.
他一直都是由约翰·哈特曼饰演的。

1659
01:09:46.600 --> 01:09:47.960
You might recognize John.
你可能认得约翰。

1660
01:09:48.220 --> 01:09:55.720
He had roles in Mad Men, Arrested Development, The Good Place, Black-ish, Space Force, and Monk.
他在《广告狂人》、《发展受阻》、《善地》、《黑人一家亲》、《太空部队》和《神探阿蒙》中都有过角色。

1661
01:09:55.860 --> 01:09:56.280
Ah!
啊！

1662
01:09:56.520 --> 01:09:57.000
There it is.
原来如此。

1663
01:09:57.000 --> 01:09:57.700
Of course.
当然了。

1664
01:09:58.000 --> 01:09:58.720
There it is.
原来是这样。

1665
01:09:59.220 --> 01:10:02.980
Well, you think Kendall is going to get Hawley's back, right?
嗯，你觉得肯德尔会支持霍莉，对吧？

1666
01:10:02.980 --> 01:10:04.160
Right, and agree with her.
没错，会同意她的观点。

1667
01:10:04.320 --> 01:10:09.780
But instead, he just shuts her down, says he doesn't really see this as a huge infraction.
但相反，他直接拒绝了她，说他并不认为这是一个严重的违规行为。

1668
01:10:10.000 --> 01:10:14.340
And what she needed to do was to get everyone through that binder.
而她需要做的是让每个人都看完那本手册。

1669
01:10:14.540 --> 01:10:15.740
That was her job.
那是她的工作。

1670
01:10:16.220 --> 01:10:16.460
Yeah.
是的。

1671
01:10:16.740 --> 01:10:18.580
We just needed you to get signatures.
我们只是需要你拿到签名。

1672
01:10:19.000 --> 01:10:20.860
Are you able to get signatures or not?
你到底能不能拿到签名？

1673
01:10:20.980 --> 01:10:23.380
Because every other branch got signatures.
因为其他所有分部都拿到了签名。

1674
01:10:23.380 --> 01:10:26.760
And I think Michael feels badly for her in this moment.
我觉得迈克尔在这一刻为她感到难过。

1675
01:10:27.100 --> 01:10:28.520
I feel badly for her.
我也为她感到难过。

1676
01:10:28.680 --> 01:10:29.300
I do, too.
我也是。

1677
01:10:29.800 --> 01:10:32.500
She's doing the right thing, and corporate doesn't have her back.
她在做正确的事，而公司总部却不支持她。

1678
01:10:32.740 --> 01:10:39.260
So Holly is just going to go out to the bullpen and say, hey, guys, I have to finish this ethics training.
所以霍莉打算走到办公区说，嘿，伙计们，我必须完成这个道德培训。

1679
01:10:39.420 --> 01:10:43.820
She has to finish reading from the binder so she can say she did it.
她必须读完手册，这样她才能说她完成了任务。

1680
01:10:44.160 --> 01:10:46.340
No one is giving her any respect.
没有人尊重她。

1681
01:10:46.340 --> 01:10:47.380
Mm-mm.
嗯。

1682
01:10:47.620 --> 01:10:49.220
Well, Michael's going to step up.
好吧，迈克尔要挺身而出了。

1683
01:10:49.400 --> 01:10:49.740
Yeah.
是的。

1684
01:10:50.160 --> 01:10:51.840
Because he does feel bad for her.
因为他确实为她感到难过。

1685
01:10:51.980 --> 01:10:56.840
So he goes out there, and he goes, if you don't get it, he loses it.
所以他走出去，他说，如果你们不配合，他就要发火了。

1686
01:10:57.040 --> 01:10:57.760
It's so funny.
太搞笑了。

1687
01:10:57.900 --> 01:10:58.680
Everyone goes in.
大家都进去了。

1688
01:10:58.780 --> 01:11:00.040
She reads from the binder.
她开始读手册。

1689
01:11:00.280 --> 01:11:04.960
And the look on Michael's face as she's reading from the boring binder.
当她读着那本无聊的手册时，迈克尔脸上的表情。

1690
01:11:05.220 --> 01:11:06.180
He's in love again.
他又坠入爱河了。

1691
01:11:06.420 --> 01:11:08.060
Well, I don't think he ever fell out of love.
嗯，我觉得他从来没停止过爱她。

1692
01:11:08.160 --> 01:11:09.460
They had their first spat.
他们只是有了第一次争吵。

1693
01:11:09.700 --> 01:11:10.760
I guess they did.
我想是的。

1694
01:11:10.960 --> 01:11:11.180
Yeah.
是的。

1695
01:11:11.420 --> 01:11:13.280
Because Holly looks appreciative.
因为霍莉看起来很感激。

1696
01:11:13.280 --> 01:11:16.240
They're both like, oh, OK, we're back.
他们俩都觉得，哦，好吧，我们和好了。

1697
01:11:16.380 --> 01:11:17.360
We're going to get through this.
我们会度过这个难关的。

1698
01:11:17.740 --> 01:11:20.760
At the very end of this episode, we have a tag.
在这一集的最后，我们有一个彩蛋。

1699
01:11:21.700 --> 01:11:23.020
Everyone's in the break room.
大家都在休息室里。

1700
01:11:23.120 --> 01:11:26.720
They're eating steak that was clearly provided by Meredith.
他们在吃牛排，显然是梅雷迪思提供的。

1701
01:11:27.200 --> 01:11:29.900
We had a fan question from Kelly W.
我们收到一个来自凯莉·W的粉丝提问。

1702
01:11:30.200 --> 01:11:31.500
OK, Kelly, what is it?
好的，凯莉，是什么问题？

1703
01:11:31.900 --> 01:11:37.080
During the last scene when everyone's eating steak in the break room, what is everyone actually eating?
在最后一个场景里，大家在休息室吃牛排的时候，每个人到底吃的是什么？

1704
01:11:37.360 --> 01:11:41.080
Is it prop food or actually real expensive steak?
是道具食物，还是真的昂贵牛排？

1705
01:11:41.080 --> 01:11:42.460
And Savi A.
还有萨维·A

1706
01:11:42.800 --> 01:11:46.520
wants to know, Angela, what were you eating since your character is a vegetarian?
想问安吉拉，你吃的是什么，因为你的角色是素食主义者？

1707
01:11:46.860 --> 01:11:48.300
I was eating potatoes.
我吃的是土豆。

1708
01:11:48.620 --> 01:11:49.940
That's what it looked like to me.
我看起来也是这样。

1709
01:11:50.220 --> 01:11:51.020
I was eating potatoes.
我吃的是土豆。

1710
01:11:51.180 --> 01:11:52.240
That's something we thought about.
这是我们考虑过的问题。

1711
01:11:52.640 --> 01:11:58.800
One of the things that Peter and Vartan shared is that our prop food was amazingly good food.
彼得和瓦坦分享过的一件事是，我们的道具食物好得惊人。

1712
01:11:58.940 --> 01:11:59.340
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

1713
01:11:59.520 --> 01:12:02.380
That they didn't give us like kind of crappy food to eat in scenes.
他们没有在拍摄时给我们吃那种劣质食物。

1714
01:12:02.700 --> 01:12:04.860
And Peter and Vartan would work with props.
彼得和瓦坦会和道具组沟通。

1715
01:12:04.860 --> 01:12:10.220
But I would have to think that Phil Shea and his team got us really good food from a restaurant.
但我认为菲尔·谢伊和他的团队给我们准备的是餐馆里真正的好食物。

1716
01:12:10.460 --> 01:12:11.940
That was going to be my guess.
我猜也是这样。

1717
01:12:12.180 --> 01:12:14.480
Whenever I ate food in the scene, it was delicious.
每当我在戏里吃东西时，味道都很棒。

1718
01:12:14.880 --> 01:12:15.140
Yeah.
是啊。

1719
01:12:15.360 --> 01:12:18.100
So it was probably some really good steak.
所以那可能真的是很好的牛排。

1720
01:12:18.360 --> 01:12:18.580
Yeah.
没错。

1721
01:12:18.800 --> 01:12:19.880
What a day at work.
这工作一天过得可真好。

1722
01:12:20.040 --> 01:12:23.700
Hey, guys, come in and eat these steak and ribs for an hour.
嘿，伙计们，进来吃一个小时的牛排和排骨吧。

1723
01:12:24.200 --> 01:12:25.360
Angela, you can have these potatoes.
安吉拉，你可以吃这些土豆。

1724
01:12:25.700 --> 01:12:26.560
Sorry, Ange.
抱歉啦，安吉。

1725
01:12:27.680 --> 01:12:29.080
Well, there you have it.
好了，答案就是这样。

1726
01:12:29.220 --> 01:12:30.480
That's business ethics.
这就是商业道德。

1727
01:12:30.980 --> 01:12:31.240
Yeah.
是啊。

1728
01:12:31.520 --> 01:12:33.220
Thank you so much to Amy Ryan.
非常感谢艾米·瑞恩。

1729
01:12:33.220 --> 01:12:38.580
And thank you to James O'Kerry for giving me the lowdown on Coopers.
也感谢詹姆斯·奥凯利为我提供了关于《办公室》的内幕消息。

1730
01:12:38.900 --> 01:12:45.880
And thank you to BJ Novak for pitching Peter and Vartan and Sergio and Alan to do the DVD commentary.
还要感谢BJ·诺瓦克提议让彼得、瓦坦、塞尔吉奥和艾伦来做DVD评论。

1731
01:12:45.880 --> 01:12:47.420
That was just so wonderful.
那真是太棒了。

1732
01:12:47.860 --> 01:12:51.380
If you guys love the show, you'll love these commentaries.
如果你们喜欢这部剧，你们也会喜欢这些评论音轨的。

1733
01:12:51.660 --> 01:12:55.680
Well, I think on that note, I might go have a volcano.
好吧，说到这里，我也许要去吃个火山蛋糕了。

1734
01:12:56.140 --> 01:13:01.100
And I hope all of you guys have some hardcore love in your life.
希望你们所有人的生活中都有热烈的爱。

1735
01:13:01.100 --> 01:13:03.580
For approximately 19 minutes.
大约19分钟。

1736
01:13:03.820 --> 01:13:05.520
Or an average of six minutes.
或者平均6分钟。

1737
01:13:05.960 --> 01:13:07.120
That would be fine.
那样也挺好。

1738
01:13:08.240 --> 01:13:09.360
See you next week.
下周见。

1739
01:13:09.460 --> 01:13:09.940
Bye, guys.
再见，伙计们。

1740
01:13:14.730 --> 01:13:16.450
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

